{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cd369c39-a44c-8142-8b90-89856e66852b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T11:07:34-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kathleen Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:04:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:04:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I got a parking ticket and I want to dispute it. It's for being too close to a hydrant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:04:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you have the ticket in front of you? There should be a number near the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:05:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, it's on my dashboard still. Um, it's, actually first, it says fifteen feet but I measured and it was more than that. I'm the, I mean, do you need the number first. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:05:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Number first, then we'll get to the tape measure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:05:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. It's four, four, one, seven, two, nine, zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:05:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four four one seven two nine zero. Got it. Where was the car parked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Out front of my shop, near the hydrant by 8 Bliss Road. Well, the shop's there. The car was about a car length down from it. I'd say twenty feet at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:05:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the ticket was written when?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:05:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Last Thursday, morning. I think around nine. Oh, wait, you mean the date. It's the eleventh, I think. Let me look. Yes, the eleventh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:05:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So you'd file an appeal on that ticket. You can do it in writing, and it helps to include photos showing the distance from the hydrant to your bumper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:06:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I took photos, actually. With a tape measure in them. Okay. And how long does the appeal take? Like, from when I send it in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:06:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a few weeks before you hear back. Could be longer if it's busy around the holidays. Just keep the ticket handy and don't ignore the due date in the meantime, since that's what causes late charges to pile on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:06:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few weeks. Okay. So I should do the appeal before the due date, not wait for the answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:06:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. File first, then wait for the answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:06:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Sorry, I'm in the middle of packing for a weekend away and I can't decide on shoes. Boots or the other ones. That's not relevant. Where do I send the appeal?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:06:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring it to the window at City Hall or mail it to the finance office. I'd go boots, it's December. Do you want the mailing address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:07:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Boots, you think? Okay. Sorry, yes, the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:07:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's City Hall, Finance Department, attention parking violations, Newport, Rhode Island. The street address is on the ticket itself too, on the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:07:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, the back. I didn't flip it over. Okay, I'll find it there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:07:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Enjoy the weekend, and good luck with the shoes."
    }
  ],
